&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;笹徳印刷工業㈱〔現笹徳印刷㈱〕取締役（非常勤)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
